{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不甘心停下、放不下珍惜之物和方向难定，都是对拉扯与抗拒的心理概括，没有新增具体人物、往事或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"亲近、安心过日子的愿望是对温柔、熟悉与安全感的抽象解释，没有把故乡、旧时光或具体人物关系写成真实经历。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"暂时专注眼前之事、获得片刻松快以及重新想到先前的决定，都是心理过程，且先前的行动决定已有上下文依据，没有把珠子中的离场比喻写成实际事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-2明确写了不甘被失落压垮、仍想继续向前，足以支撑S03-1的不甘心停下。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-3已经交代珍惜之物难以再像从前那样拥有，直接支撑放不下这些东西，也能解释继续向前与有所牵挂之间的拉扯。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"压住难过造成的窒息感可能加重犹疑，但S03-1主要把方向难定归于放不下珍惜之物，没有明确显示压抑难过如何继续起作用。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-3提供了‘那些东西’的指称，却没有说明它们为何连着亲近、安心过日子的愿望，这层含义主要是S03-2新加的解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-2已经写出动起来后的底气和继续向前的意愿，能够支撑他仍在做眼前之事，也使先前的行动决定继续与当下有关。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-1确实提供了被想起的行动决定，但它是回忆的内容而不必然是此刻回想的触发原因，眼前愿望尚未实现才更像触发点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-3写明他难以再拥有珍惜之物、眼前责任又使他顾不上它们，足以构成亲近而安心的生活尚未实现的现实限制。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条之间的指代链从珍惜之物延伸到亲近、安心过日子的愿望，再落到这样的日子尚未实现，能够读出短暂松快后又回到先前决定的变化。 \",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R13\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"‘先前那个决定又回到眼前，等着他重新面对’在修补后只剩‘又想起当初决定先动起来’，保留了决定重新浮现，却弱化了它再次成为一个必须处理、必须面对的问题所带来的压力。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d75251be-754d-4ded-bef3-78f2c4e10ffd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T064202392757Z", "elapsed_seconds": 493.344, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:50:15.735624+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "667ba59444fd74c2e974ebe55c7397f8408e6decfb7439e28ca69033d67f7c38", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T064202392757Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1baaac1fd638335690d5a7176d5c6cc7ee0c5647fced8c8f9030a70c7b1ca2fd"}}}
